    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23341" root="شوق" body-key="$">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اشاقهُ</span></b>  signifies <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَجَدَهُ شَائِقًا</span> [app. meaning,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاشِقًا</span>, i. e. <i>He found him to be an excessive,</i> or
<i>attached,</i> or <i>admiring, lover</i>]. (IAar, * TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
One says also, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا أَشْوَقَنِى إِلَيْكَ</span> [<i>How great is my
desire,</i> or <i>the yearning</i> or <i>longing of my soul, for
thee!</i>]. (TA.)

